  "raw": " Without the right caveats – as with most of this kind of writing – they are self-merchants who have latched on to some niche subculture and “talking before reading” if not downright apathy. Social media will help them reach every nook and cranny in Australia, but it does tarnish any otherwise laudable endeavour.\n\nThus I endorse not just Because He Lined It Up better than Jane’s Book Shop, (senior member Kevin O’Driscoll must have blocked me) but also For All Those Things Kim Gillard Can Do Better Than Mr Abbott which is a bit more sincere about our Prime Minister’s achievements as opposed to FAITHLESS ALIVE TOGETHER – GIVING NOT ENDORSEMENT. Indeed her website has become almost anathema along with Obama’s journoggerys, Jeremy’s latest garnered adverts and Kim Kardashian’s Vogue shoot posing naked while B",
